"P2638260464" "taskMission"
// IntroString :
"P3246628938" "We may have a problem with Special Operative Rauscher, the leader of the Arachnos lab tasked with investigating the Red Hands. Lately, he's been erratic. Half the time he doesn't file his reports, and when he does, they're sketchy to say the least. Ghost Widow's concerned that Rauscher may be using Arachnos property for his own pursuits. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to check out the lab and bring Rauscher back to me.</a> I think I can get the truth out of him."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


