"P4052931520" "All right. Rauscher's in the spirit world, and we have to get him back. At all costs. According to that file you found, Rauscher has managed to open a portal to the spirit world inside a sewer tunnel over in Dockside. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get there and see if you can follow him.</a> It's the only way to save ourselves from Ghost Widow's wrath."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


